name hep-paper
category Package
revision 61171
shortdesc Publications in High Energy Physics
longdesc This package aims to provide a single style file containing
longdesc most configurations and macros necessary to write appealing
longdesc publications in High Energy Physics. Instead of reinventing the
longdesc wheel by introducing newly created macros, hep-paper preferably
longdesc loads third party packages as long as they are light-weight
longdesc enough. For usual publications it suffices to load the
longdesc hep-paper package, without optional arguments, in addition to
longdesc the article class.
